never underestimate the power of a good  medic the ability to revive and heal  your teammates can dramatically turn the  tide of a battle so if you're going to  be playing medic you want to make sure  you know what you're doing here are some  tips for those of you playing medic in  battlefield one let's start with the  basics you're going to want to always be  around teammates keeping everyone healed  no one benefits from a medic that  decides to lonewolf it here yourself  with the assault class your rifle will  complement their submachine gun nicely  and you can keep them alive while they  deal with those tanks you're completely  useless against because healing is your  number one priority you also want to  stay in the back of your squad drop a  med pack if you know if I is going to  break out so you can get healing as  quickly as possible you can throw your  bandages at a pretty decent range  meaning you can safely stay in cover  when healing your allies and if a guy  goes down revive him just remember to  make sure that the people who kill them  are dead first we are losing objective  doc this is a battlefield game after all  and the medic gets to shoot with the  rifle you got the rigotti as your  default which is a pretty good  middle-of-the-road gun at the m-19 07  which is perfect for those who want a  little more up close approach the au  variants auto fire turns it into a  shotgun like weapon capable a quick-fire  carrying this with the gas grenade is a  great way to storm a control point and  finally there's the Mondragon for those  of you wanting more range its long-range  scope gives you a more sniper like role  and is my personal preference but even  with these options remember you are not  the person who should be taking point on  attack or camping out with a rifle  you're a medic first and foremost and as  long as you support your teammates and  keep them alive you're doing a good job  you have any cool moments as a medic  please share them in the comments and  subscribe the game spot for even more  battlefield 1 videos  you
 

